  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hi hine ðonne begytan nyllen oððe ne mægen to þam andagan, ðonne beo he syþþan flyma, ⁊ hine lecge for ðeof se þe him tocume.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, on the appointed day, they [the relatives of such a man] will not or cannot, he shall be henceforth an outlaw, and he who encounters him may assume him to be a thief and kill him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hi hine ðanne begytan nellon oððe ne magon to ðam andagan, ðonne beo hé syððan flyma, ⁊ hine lecge for ðeof se ðe him tocume.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
